        <message_html><![CDATA[<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto"><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">A file may require attention</span></p>
</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">Good day,</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">This email serves as a notification that a file reported via the &ldquo;OHS Management System&rdquo; may require&nbsp;the attention of the Wellness team.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">Please review the file to determine if actions may be required.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">The required actions may include&nbsp;support or consult for the following,&nbsp;but is not limited to:</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>Physical or psychological injury<span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li>Mental health<span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li>Health related advice and resources<span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">Click the link below to access the file:</span></p>
${URI_REF}</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto">Thank you,</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Occupational Health and Safety</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">House of Commons </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8</span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto"><span data-fontsize="11">th</span></span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto"> floor </span>&nbsp;<br /><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</span></span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Office: 613- 995-3614</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto"><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></span></p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Un dossier peut n&eacute;cessit&eacute; une attention</span></p>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Bonjour,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Ce courriel&nbsp;sert &agrave; vous signaler qu'un dossier (d&eacute;clar&eacute; via le syst&egrave;me de gestion SST) peut n&eacute;cessiter</span><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">&nbsp;</span><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">l'attention de l'&eacute;quipe&nbsp;de&nbsp;bien-&ecirc;tre.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Veuillez examiner le dossier pour d&eacute;terminer si des actions&nbsp;sont&nbsp;requises.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Les actions requises peuvent inclure une assistance ou une consultation pour les &eacute;l&eacute;ments suivants, mais sans s'y limiter :</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li>Blessure physique ou psychologique&nbsp;</li>
<li>Sant&eacute; mentale&nbsp;</li>
<li>Conseils et ressources li&eacute;s &agrave; la sant&eacute;&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Cliquez sur le lien ci-dessous pour acc&eacute;der au fichier:&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">${URI_REF}</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-FR" data-contrast="auto">Merci,</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>]]></message_html>
